# Bloodghast has haste while an opponent has 10 or less life: on turn 3 two Lightning Bolts and a Fireblast (sacrificing two
# Mountains, tapped for their mana first) take Bot2 from 20 to exactly 10, the line itself. Black Lotus and Mox Jet then pay
# for the Bloodghast, which attacks the turn it is cast for 2: Bot2 ends at 8.

